{"reviews":[{"id":"B07THXX6VD-0","r":1.0,"t":"Waste Of Time And Money \ud83d\udcb4","x":"Before I received the package I was very much excited that I can use it on my many customers that I have since I am a cosmetologist. However once I received them I tried them out the next day, to my surprise it isn\u2019t at all what I expected. The product wasn\u2019t adjustable as identified in the listing. The product doesn\u2019t latch, so I was forced to used pins, also when wrapped around the hair the product becomes condensed. It\u2019s not firm. It seemed like I was wrapping tissue around my customers hair.","h":14,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B07THXX6VD-1","r":1.0,"t":"Not worth the money","x":"They do not work. I will not order again. These were a complete and total waste of money. They are also big for those with a small to average size head","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B07THXX6VD-2","r":3.0,"t":"Don't look for a \"grip\" from these bands... offers added friction only.","x":"This does not keep a lace front from blowing away from your edges. This is not a substitute for glue. In the wind, sis, you will be embarrassed without something else to keep those edges down.  These bands make it a little harder for the wig to slide backwards but the wig has to be tight in the first darn place. It's really just added friction. You'll be disappointed if you buy this expecting a \"grip\".  The velcro closure is cheaply made, big and bulky but manageable. I'll use what I brought but","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B07THXX6VD-3","r":4.0,"t":"Good product with good value for the money","x":"They really don\u2019t fit that well, or maybe it\u2019s just me. I\u2019m new to this wig game. If it had more Velcro so that it adjusted better, I plan on adding my own. But for the price it A very good product. I plan to continue working on them until I get it perfected.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07THXX6VD-4","r":5.0,"t":"Not One for the money. 8!","x":"Stretches out fast but enough to adjust. Wish you could request 3 color selection. BUT GREAT VALUE ESPECIALLY WHEN YOU JUST START OUT...","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B07THXX6VD-5","r":3.0,"t":"Just ok, not as good as I needed.","x":"Quality was not as good as advertised by merchant. Did hold well or staying power was not that good.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B07THXX6VD-6","r":5.0,"t":"A \u201cMUST HAVE\u201d for Wigs!","x":"You\u2019ll definitely want to purchase these. I love the variety of colors and you can\u2019t beat the price. The protection is amazing and your unit \u201cwill not\u201d move. These bands last a long time and they\u2019re very durable.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B07THXX6VD-7","r":4.0,"t":"Good value- could be smaller","x":"Overall these are a great value for the money. I just never can understand why they\u2019re never made to go any smaller. It seems like even at the smallest it\u2019s still not tight then when they begin to stretch overtime they become useless. I guess that\u2019s why you get so many.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B07THXX6VD-8","r":1.0,"t":"My wig keep sliding","x":"These didn't work , my wig keep sliding back. the material was not thick enough to work... going back to my original seller. I rather pay more for something that will work..","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B07THXX6VD-9","r":5.0,"t":"Work like supposed to....","x":"They hold my wigs on like they are supposed to. And I can use the different color with the different colors. They're super easy to use and stay in place.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B07THXX6VD-10","r":2.0,"t":"Never again","x":"They are to big not what I expected and they don\u2019t do what\u2019s promised wigs still slip don\u2019t know who heads be that big","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B07THXX6VD-11","r":5.0,"t":"Nice product","x":"Very nice. Does exactly what it needs to do.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B07THXX6VD-12","r":5.0,"t":"Decent","x":"I added more Velcro for a more secure fit.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B07THXX6VD-13","r":1.0,"t":"I will not buy again.","x":"The velcro is sticky. That is the only plus.  My head is huge. It is big on me. If you pull it tight, it curls and is useless that way. I cut a section out and sewed it together.  I folded it and sewed it as well. Both worked to keep me from pulling it to be as tight as I needed it. But defeats the purpose of buying them. I'm not happy, but I made them work somewhat.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B07THXX6VD-14","r":5.0,"t":"Great product, GREAT price!","x":"these are super comfy.  love the colors!  i cut them down for a better fit and there's no loss in grip strength.  my wigs feel secure.  tips:  for windy days,  etc., i highly suggest Got2b glued around the forehead and sides of your head for an extra secure grip.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2021"},{"id":"B07THXX6VD-15","r":1.0,"t":"Horrible Product","x":"I dislike that they did not stick. There is no grip to make/help the wig stay on your head.  I have ordered other wig grips and they are awesome! The wig sticks to the grip and does not move.  These are nothing like that. Do not waste your money on these.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B07THXX6VD-16","r":1.0,"t":"Wig gone Wrong\u2026","x":"Didn\u2019t Really like This Product.. I bought it to Grip A Wig I was Wearing at the time. It didn\u2019t Hold the Wig on my Head & It Slipped off\u2026 Had Not my real Hair Been Longer than the actual wig I would have been more embarrassed\u2026.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B07THXX6VD-17","r":1.0,"t":"It doesn't work","x":"Very thin, flimsy, cheap & poorly made...it's called a wig grip but it's not secure, moves & slides off your head. I had to reorder from the original company. I call myself looking for a deal...I guess u get what u pay for!!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B07THXX6VD-18","r":4.0,"t":"These serve their purpose","x":"My mom uses these to keep her wigs from falling off, after her hair has thinned a lot. She has a small head circumference, and these help to keep her wigs from shifting, or  coming off, especially on a very windy days.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B07THXX6VD-19","r":1.0,"t":"Dont buy they come already stretched out.","x":"These are too big and stretched out. Not a good buy at all. I have bought similar ones and they come perfect size not stretched. I decided to try these since it comes in multiple colors. I will be returning them.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B07THXX6VD-20","r":5.0,"t":"Where have these been all my life?","x":"I love these! U get a lot for the price, they are super comfortable and they do exactly what they are supposed to...keep the headwrap from slipping!!! Thanks so much recommending to everyone I know! Must have!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B07THXX6VD-21","r":3.0,"t":"Making it work.","x":"This was too big for my head. I use Bobby pins to tighten and make it stay in place. I also feel like the velvet isn't strong enough. I have it on the right side but I don't feel like it adds enough resistance.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B07THXX6VD-22","r":5.0,"t":"Great product for the right price","x":"The first time I saw this product was on a high end wig site.  Selling 1 band for $15.  I knew there had to be some out there cheaper.  Found it here.  Great price and they work just like the expensive one.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B07THXX6VD-23","r":1.0,"t":"Not very useful when wearing a wig","x":"But to use for comicon. These just cause the weeks to come off even quicker. They\u2019re comfortable if you\u2019re just using it for a headband! They\u2019re not a great value for the money! Would not buy again","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B07THXX6VD-24","r":5.0,"t":"Get the job done","x":"I bought these because my headscarf\u2019s kept sliding off my head. It may be because I don\u2019t have the right material scarf that compliments my hair, but these bands help keep the scarf in place.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find these bands a good value for the price, especially for beginners.","cites":[4,5,7,8,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers say the bands are too big or don't fit well, even on larger heads, and wish they adjusted smaller.","cites":[2,8,11,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers report the bands don't hold wigs securely and wigs still slide, with limited grip compared to glue.","cites":[3,6,9,11]},{"text":"A number of reviewers say the bands work well and hold wigs in place as intended.","cites":[7,10,12,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers note the bands stretch out over time or lack enough Velcro for proper adjustment.","cites":[4,5,8,14]}]},"qa":[]}